{"id":115,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"伝統と国際教育で自立を育む和洋国府台女子","feature_description":"和洋国府台女子中学校は、国際的に活躍するためのコミュニケーション能力と知性・品格を備え、社会に貢献できる女性の育成を掲げています。日本の伝統文化と国際教育を通じて自立した女性を育てる方針です。中高6年のカリキュラムでは、大学進学と生涯にわたる学習を見すえた基礎力を築き、英語や探究型の学びを取り入れています。学びと学校生活を6年間でつなぐ構成です。","clubs":[{"id":1819,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wayokonodai.ed.jp/faq/junior/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1821,"name":"ソフトテニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wayokonodai.ed.jp/faq/junior/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1822,"name":"ダンス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wayokonodai.ed.jp/faq/junior/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1823,"name":"陸上","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wayokonodai.ed.jp/faq/junior/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1824,"name":"卓球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wayokonodai.ed.jp/faq/junior/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1825,"name":"ソフトボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wayokonodai.ed.jp/faq/junior/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1826,"name":"水泳","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wayokonodai.ed.jp/faq/junior/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1827,"name":"バドミントン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wayokonodai.ed.jp/faq/junior/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1830,"name":"吹奏楽","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.wayokonodai.ed.jp/faq/junior/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1831,"name":"美術","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.wayokonodai.ed.jp/faq/junior/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1832,"name":"茶道","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.wayokonodai.ed.jp/faq/junior/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1833,"name":"華道","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.wayokonodai.ed.jp/faq/junior/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1834,"name":"箏","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.wayokonodai.ed.jp/faq/junior/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1835,"name":"演劇","category":"文